listing:   occ.cpp, fed with the compiler's numbers for pressure.hip
toolchain: g++ (Ubuntu 13.3.0-6ubuntu2~24.04.1) 13.3.0; Ubuntu clang version 17.0.6 (9ubuntu1) (the compiler that hipcc drives; HIP 5.7)
command:   g++ -std=c++20 -Wall -Wextra -Wpedantic -Werror -g -fsanitize=address,undefined occ.cpp -o .bin_occ && hipcc -std=c++17 -O2 --offload-arch=gfx90a --cuda-device-only -S pressure.hip -o .tmp.s 2>/dev/null && awk '/^_Z[0-9]+accum/ && /:/ {split($1,a,":"); name=a[1]} /; TotalNumVgprs:/ {v=$3} /; LDSByteSize:/ {l=$3} /; Occupancy:/ {print name, v, l, (name ~ /accumLB/ ? 256 : 1024), $3}' .tmp.s | sed -E 's/^_Z[0-9]+([A-Za-z]+)ILi([0-9]+)E[^ ]*/\1<\2>/' | ./.bin_occ
